Asian fusion BBQ bringing East-meets-West flavors to Garden Grove! 🔥🥩

@smokequeenbbq is serving up their unique take on barbecue with brisket burnt ends, Wagyu tri-tip with Saigon cilantro sauce, crispy pork belly, char siu pork belly, brisket, sausages, pork ribs, and plenty of sides. 🤤

Don’t forget their Mango Michelada and Strawberry Lemonade, and save room for the Mango Misu and tallow-fried churros with ube dipping sauce! 💜

📍 12941 9th St, Garden Grove, CA 92840

